HEADER: COMPENSATING RED CAPTURE for risk-adaptive-layer T-007, taken
2026-08-26 against the CURRENT suites. NOT the original red -- none was
preserved, because the per-task cycle was never run for this task (PR #16,
merge 4a215ed, 2026-06-14). Authorized by
`docs/review-tickets/RT-20260826-002-waiver-t007-red-log.md`.

T-007 delivers TWO independent controls, so this capture carries TWO
mutations, each applied to BOTH runtime twins simultaneously in a clone-based
scratch tree. Mutating only the sh master was tried first and REJECTED as
unsound: the ps1 suite exercises the ps1 implementation, so it stayed green
and the differential would have proved nothing about that half.

MUTATION A -- evidence signing (T-007a):
  check-evidence-bundle.sh  : the hmac.compare_digest guard -> a constant false
  check-evidence-bundle.ps1 : the OrdinalIgnoreCase comparison guard -> $false
  RESULT sh  : exit 1, PASS 160 / FAIL 1
               FAIL: T-007a.3: should fail with HMAC mismatch.
  RESULT ps1 : exit 1, aborts by throw at scripts.tests.ps1:2203, raised by
               assertion T-007a.3 (the ps1 harness throws on the first failed
               assertion instead of tallying, so it stops there)

MUTATION B -- two-person approval (T-007b):
  check-task-state.sh       : the distinct-approver guard -> a constant false
  check-task-state.ps1      : the same guard -> $false
  RESULT sh  : exit 1, PASS 160 / FAIL 1
               FAIL: T-007b.3: should report need for two distinct approvers
  RESULT ps1 : exit 1, aborts by throw at scripts.tests.ps1:2500, raised by
               assertion T-007b.3

Both mutations were reverted between phases and the tree re-run: sh returned
to exit 0 / PASS 161 / FAIL 0 and ps1 to exit 0, so neither red is a residue
of the other and neither is a broken tree.

Each mutation reddens exactly ONE assertion, and the SAME id on both runtimes.
That is the property this differential exists to establish: the delivered
enforcement is load-bearing, it is load-bearing on both twins, and the
assertions guarding it are not vacuous.

